      "body": "Dividend of ₹15.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 20th February 2026 Payment date: 12th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 5.1%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by both earnings (71% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (53% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 43% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. Earnings per share has grown by 21% over the last 5 years. Unless this trend reverses, it should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
